There I was, about to win the game for the third time in just over a
week, (well, I was a pretty tough little Samurai, could kill a dragon
without losing a hit point, had everything I thought I needed,
except...) I was exploring the Wizard level before dealing with him
when I stepped on a land-mine. I had no speed potion or jelly, so I
did 50. to let my legs heal when THE WIZARD APPEARED!!! WHAT!!! Why
did he come before I went and got him?!?! This has never happened.
Conflict doesn't work with him of course, so besides teleporting a
couple of times, I thought there was nothing much I could to. ACtually
of course, I just panicked---all I had to do was drop my non-essential
stuff. Fuck and Damn. I panicked so badly I even forgot to put on my
second amulet of life saving after my first one was used :-( That will
teach me not to save the game and go away and think when I get into
such sticky situations. I've died a thousand horrible deaths at the
hands of the Wizard and others when I've had the Amulet in my hands
and always figured out a way I could have saved myself about two
minutes later. :-( :-( :-( :-( :-(

Lawrence.


